  "description": "<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-weight: bold;\">For the Bay Clothing Company</strong> has been a vision and Dream for many years.&nbsp; Growing up in Youngstown, Ohio, I was and will always be a Buckeye.&nbsp; I grew up a Fanatic for the Cleveland Browns, Indians, and Cavaliers.&nbsp; The Passion and Pride the state of Ohio has for their sports teams is unmatched... until now!</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">I have now spent the majority of my life here in Tampa Bay, my children were born here, it is&nbsp;our HOME and I am proud to share my passion and Love for this community with all of you!</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">My wife and co-owner is a unicorn...she is one of the few but growing number of people who have been Born and \"RAYSed\" right here in the Tampa Bay area.&nbsp; Her love for the Tampa Bay community is second to none, and has made sure our children grow up Proud to call Tampa Bay HOME!&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">With the creation of&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-weight: bold;\">For the Bay&nbsp;Clothing Company,</strong>&nbsp;it is&nbsp;our hope that we can bring that Pride, Passion, and LOVE for Tampa Bay to new heights...one t-shirt at a time!&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">Thank you for Wearing Tampa Bay PROUD!&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Karla, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center;\">We are...&nbsp;<em style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-style: italic;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; font-weight: bold;\">FOR THE BAY!&nbsp;</strong></em></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>",
